            "type": "text",
            "text": "Effect",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The halberd attempts to absorb one of the creature's prepared arcane spells or arcane spell slots. If the creature struck fails a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:will",
            "dc": 37
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save, it loses an arcane spell (or lose an unused arcane spell slot) as if it'd cast that spell. The spell or slot lost is randomly determined from the highest rank available, starting at 6th rank and working down. The halberd passes this absorbed energy on to their wielder, who becomes "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "6517bbf2-8085-534b-be6a-187d52739fa0"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for 1 round and can use the extra action only to Strike with the halberd."
          }
        ]
      },
