          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sorshen's Sinuous Guisarme",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+4 mythic striking keen quickstrike shifting spell reservoir high-grade dawnsilver guisarme",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The weapon's unique double-bladed design combined with her magical nature grants her the twin weapon trait. Her spell reservoir rune typically contains blindness. Her power and intelligence are derived from a magical gemstone containing 13 of Sorshen's dreams, all so outlandish or salacious that most would consider them to be nightmares—although these dreams have been transforming into less horrific visions as Sorshen's changing philosophies continue to influence her weapon. The guisarme can use 3 actions per turn, acting on her wielder's turn. These actions don't count against her wielder's."
          }
        ]
      },
